  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "DingTalk",
      "text": "**把 DSH 的任务结果送到钉钉群。**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk)\n\n**[安装使用](#安装) · [使用流程](#开始使用) · [完整说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "DingTalk",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-zh-light.svg\" alt=\"把 DSH 的任务结果送到钉钉群。 · 流程示意\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- 发送纯文本或 Markdown 通知。\n- 按自己的机器人配置使用加签。\n- 先自检和测试，再用于正式通知。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 DSH 桌面版「插件」面板安装 `dsh-dingtalk`。已配置命令行时也可使用：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-dingtalk\n```\n\n网页版把 `desktop` 改为 `web`；安装后重启对应的 DSH。宿主要求以包声明 `>=0.2.1-rc.3` 为准。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始使用",
      "text": "1. 在自己的钉钉群创建自定义机器人，取得 webhook 和加签密钥。\n2. 在 DSH 插件设置中填写配置，先执行配置自检。\n3. 在自己的测试群确认一条简单通知能送达，再准备正式消息。\n4. 给助手消息内容和目标群，确认后发送，并在钉钉检查收到的文本或 Markdown。\n\n可以这样说：\n\n> 先检查钉钉机器人配置，准备一条任务完成通知，发送前让我核对正文。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开始前要知道",
      "text": "需要自己的群机器人 webhook；请先在测试群确认消息能送达。\n\n配置、完整工具与排错见[详细使用说明](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "插件更新",
      "text": "在工作台或原生插件详情页底部检查更新。默认自动检查，**默认不自动安装**；是否安装、何时重启由你决定。Suite 管理的组件随整包更新。[查看更新规则](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "文档",
      "text": "- [详细使用、配置与边界](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.zh.md)\n- [更新记录](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [验证范围与历史](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/VALIDATION.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "反馈与贡献",
      "text": "如果插件帮到了你，欢迎 Star，让更多人发现它。问题和建议请提交 [Issues](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/issues)，也欢迎代码与文档 [PR](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/pulls)。反馈时附上版本与复现步骤，并移除凭据。"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/LICENSE)\n\n<a id=\"依赖与配置\"></a>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[简体中文](README.md) · **English**"
    },
    {
      "section": "DingTalk",
      "text": "**Send DSH task results to your DingTalk group.**\n\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk) [](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-dingtalk)\n\n**[Install](#install) · [Workflow](#start-using-it) · [Full guide](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)**"
    },
    {
      "section": "DingTalk",
      "text": "<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark) and (max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-dark.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(max-width: 640px)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-mobile-light.svg\">\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-dark.svg\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/main/docs/assets/intro/workflow-en-light.svg\" alt=\"Send DSH task results to your DingTalk group. · workflow illustration\" width=\"100%\">\n</picture>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- Send plain-text or Markdown notifications.\n- Use signing with your own robot configuration.\n- Check configuration and test before sending real notices."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "Open **Plugins** in the DSH desktop app and install `dsh-dingtalk`. If the CLI is available:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-dingtalk\n```\n\nFor the web profile, replace `desktop` with `web`. Restart that DSH profile after installation. The package’s DSH requirement is `>=0.2.1-rc.3`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Start using it",
      "text": "1. Create a custom robot in your DingTalk group and obtain its webhook and signing secret.\n2. Enter the configuration in DSH plugin settings and run the configuration check.\n3. Verify a simple notification in your own test group before preparing the real message.\n4. Provide the content and target group, confirm sending, then check the text or Markdown in DingTalk.\n\nExample request：\n\n> Check my DingTalk robot configuration and prepare a task-complete notice for review before sending."
    },
    {
      "section": "Before you start",
      "text": "Requires your own group robot webhook. Verify delivery in a test group first.\n\nConfiguration, detailed tools and troubleshooting: [full reference](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Plugin updates",
      "text": "Check updates at the bottom of the workbench or native plugin details. Automatic checks are on by default; **automatic installation is off**. You choose whether to install and when to restart. Suite-managed components update with their bundle. [Update behavior](https://github.com/STARDUSTLC666/dsh-dingtalk/blob/main/docs/REFERENCE.en.md)."
    },
